{"id":"n80742-1-7","stage":4,"title":"팥 · 红豆","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80742-1-7-1","ko":"이 붕어빵 좀 먹어 봐. 붕어빵 속에 든 팥이 무척 달다.","zh":"尝尝这个鲫鱼饼，里面的红豆馅很甜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"붕어빵","meaning":"鲫鱼饼","explanation":"붕어빵：鲫鱼饼。","readings":[{"term":"붕어빵","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:붕어빵:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"붕어빵","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붕어빵","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어","meaning":"占，吞，贪污","explanation":"먹다：占，吞，贪污；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"21","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어","audio":"/audio/65922367ccfa237c5c51.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（먹어 보다：尝一尝）","explanation":"보다：试着做（먹어 보다：尝一尝）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"붕어빵","meaning":"鲫鱼饼","explanation":"붕어빵：鲫鱼饼。","readings":[{"term":"붕어빵","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:붕어빵:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"붕어빵","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붕어빵","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3"}},{"text":"속에","meaning":"里，内，里边","explanation":"속：里，内，里边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"1","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속에","audio":"/audio/af358792204c530765b6.mp3"}},{"text":"든","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"든","audio":"/audio/fa1c170a05a6a48fc7be.mp3"}},{"text":"팥이","meaning":"红豆，小豆","explanation":"팥：红豆，小豆；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"팥","audio":"/audio/6cc2af0e2d5e5d94b754.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80742","senseId":"1","lemma":"팥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팥이","audio":"/audio/1a31edee9647505c84f2.mp3"}},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很。","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}},{"text":"달다.","meaning":"甜，甘甜","explanation":"달다：甜，甘甜；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62741","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"32f96d06af63c696","term":"붕어빵","zh":"鲫鱼饼","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3","definition":"外形像鲫鱼、通常包有红豆馅的烤制点心。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"占，吞，贪污","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将他人的物品或钱财以不正当的手段据为己有。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（먹어 보다：尝一尝）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（먹어 보다：尝一尝）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"里，内，里边","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"被外皮或外壳包裹的物体的里面部分。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"6cc2af0e2d5e5d94","term":"팥","zh":"红豆，小豆","audio":"/audio/6cc2af0e2d5e5d94b754.mp3","entryId":"80742","definition":"煮熟后熬粥或放进饼、面包里吃的，味道很香甜的深紫色粮食。","pronunciation":["팓"]},{"id":"9d4e17cb57a7915a","term":"무척","zh":"非常，很","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3","entryId":"55175","definition":"程度深得别的无法与之相比。","pronunciation":["무척"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"甜，甘甜","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62741","definition":"与蜂蜜或糖的味道相似。","pronunciation":["달다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee8d3f20e4b3221d308a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80742-1-7-2","ko":"정말 맛있다!","zh":"真好吃！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있다!","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb1087f9d734690338cd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.635,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80742","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真好吃！","尝尝这个鲫鱼饼，里面的红豆馅很甜。","这酒看起来不是家里自己酿的吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["尝尝这个鲫鱼饼，里面的红豆馅很甜。","这酒看起来不是家里自己酿的吧。","真好吃！"],"answer":2}]}
